Z||000000||sdm1964||12-18-1999||07:37 AM||||Just to let you all know the guy in Orlando is back in bussiness again. Seems the gear machine broke down but now is repaired. I seem to have missplaced his number so no help there. So all of us that have to pull up on the headlight or have them up all the time can get them fixed, Including my self.<P>i did get my check off to him before i lost his number, I do have his address if you need it. This is for the brass gear replacement on 84-86.||||reg||14
